      "paperId": "1301f782cae6a21c7a5c9a06791d5026249965ca",
      "title": "Corpo/Realities in Times of Educational Crisis: Trauma, Consumption and Dialogue in Au Revoir Les Enfants\u2606",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Tasha Ausman",
          "authorId": "107597685"
